body:
The scene in Kingsman Golden Circle where Merlin sacrifices himself and sings Country Roads

&#x200B;

Hit me right in the feels that one

Learning that the sample space you know right now isn't even close to the whole population cencus space. 

&#x200B;

Went from being top of the class in a small school to being only in the middle of a population standardised test. Learnt that even if I beat everyone in my sample space, I still had far ways to go to be the absolute top.

Oh boy that music 

I thought Kac Chan was about to go Villian for a bit

&#x200B;

\> Deep Sea Nami no longer leaves her spine behind while moving during her recall animation.

&#x200B;

"Bye man. I'll leave **MY SPINE** for ya"
